From 9c2b0173d3e58d5a0546d79ef89f13cb688c77df Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Canoziia <canoziia@projectk.org>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 14:53:35 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(deepseek-v4.1): SM80 Copy-Engine Ring DMA & lossless
 BF16 row-sharded prefill

- Add pcie_dma_ring.py wrapper for _dsv41_pcie_dma_C (raw 0-offset cudaMalloc
  IPC ring with canonical reduce_scatter / all_gather / in-place all_reduce).
- Add lossless BF16 _run_layers_prefill_row_shard in DeepseekV4Model keeping
  mHC residual [S, 4, H], mixes, and Engram post-updates sharded across TP
  ranks (1/W memory & compute) with zero torch.cat spikes, eliminating long-
  context prefill expandable_segments OOM on 4x80G while scaling cleanly to
  6/8 GPUs (conditional 2-microbatch MoE for M>=4096 or EP>=6).
- Tighten try_gate_gemv upper bound from M<=8 to M<=6 (cuBLAS wins at M>=8).
- Enable VLLM_DSV41_PREFILL_DMA_RING/ROW_SHARD/2MB_MOE=auto in tep4_fused &
  tp_auto profiles.
